@baseUrl = http://localhost:5165
@snapshotId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@jobId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Server limits and supported artifact types
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/capabilities
Accept: application/json

### Create a minimal analysis snapshot
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/snapshots
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "context": {
    "organizationUrl": "https://crm.contoso.local/Contoso",
    "organizationId": null,
    "version": "9.1",
    "apiVersion": "v9.1",
    "pageType": "entityrecord",
    "entityName": "account",
    "entityId": "3f2504e0-4f89-41d3-9a0c-0305e82c3301",
    "formId": "21b0f5f1-7c73-4cb5-9eb6-26f92dfac55a",
    "appId": null,
    "formLabel": "Account"
  },
  "artifacts": [
    {
      "kind": "formXml",
      "name": "account-main-form.xml",
      "componentId": "21b0f5f1-7c73-4cb5-9eb6-26f92dfac55a",
      "version": "1",
      "mediaType": "application/xml; charset=utf-8",
      "contentBase64": "PGZvcm0+PC9mb3JtPg==",
      "sourceUrl": "https://crm.contoso.local/Contoso/api/data/v9.1/systemforms"
    }
  ],
  "capturedAt": "2026-08-23T14:00:00Z"
}

### Snapshot metadata (does not return raw source or DLL bytes)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/snapshots/{{snapshotId}}
Accept: application/json

### Background analysis job
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/jobs/{{jobId}}
Accept: application/json

### Evidence graph and summary
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/snapshots/{{snapshotId}}/evidence
Accept: application/json

### Ask a question grounded in completed evidence
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/chat
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "snapshotId": "{{snapshotId}}",
  "question": "保存这个窗体时会执行哪些逻辑？",
  "focusComponentId": null
}

### Health/readiness check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
